  "description": "How far (or low) can an attractive body take you in a slum? Pretty and well endowed, Choi Hyung-Do scrapes together a living as a waiter by day and porn actor by night. He's occasionally called in for odd jobs at the male brothel where the charismatic owner, Lee Gyung, relentlessly tries to seduce him. Hyung-Do feels as though he’s spiraling, but his attraction to Gyung feels as real as his imminent bankruptcy. The descent may be ruthless, but it's not without its pleasures. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
